<component type="desktop-application">
  <id>io.github.Evelynnsrepos.Evelopment-Games-Designer</id>
  <name>Eve.Lopment Games Designer</name>
  <summary>Design your whole game in one free program</summary>
  <metadata_license>CC0-1.0</metadata_license>
  <project_license>GPL-3.0-only</project_license>
  <developer id="io.github.evelynnsrepos">
    <name>Evelopment Games</name>
  </developer>
  <description>
    <p>
      An all-in-one game design tool. Write your story and design documents, build a wiki, draw maps and levels,
      paint, collect ideas on boards, and keep items, characters, towns and enemies in lists that every other tool knows about.
    </p>
    <ul>
      <li>Writer, Wiki, timelines, branching stories and dialogue</li>
      <li>Item, character, town and enemy lists with stats, rarities and links between everything</li>
      <li>Map Creator, Level Layout with tilesets and Godot export, Cosmos Creator</li>
      <li>Draw: a full painting tool with pressure brushes, layers and blend modes</li>
      <li>Calculators for damage, levels, resources, economy, gacha and combat</li>
      <li>Export to Godot, Unity and Unreal; work together peer to peer</li>
    </ul>
    <p>No generative AI: every idea and every stroke is yours. Everything stays on your computer.</p>
  </description>
